  "description": [
    "A member of the class of phenylethanolamines that is 4-(2-amino-1-hydroxyethyl)-2-(hydroxymethyl)phenol having a <em>tert</em>-butyl group attached to the nirogen atom. It acts as a \u03b2-adrenergic agonist used in the treatment of asthma and chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD)."
  ],
